      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_02",
      "hash64": "794C3BF237DE32D5",
      "text": "You have my thanks for all you have done to help\\nthe League Club...and to help Kieran.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_03",
      "hash64": "794C3AF237DE3122",
      "text": "Once you became Champion, Kieran withdrew\\nhimself entirely from our ranking system.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_04",
      "hash64": "794C35F237DE28A3",
      "text": "Though I consider this somewhat sad, it is not as\\nif he and I can no longer meet.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_05",
      "hash64": "794C34F237DE26F0",
      "text": "More than anything, I am glad he seems to be\\nacting like his former self once more.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_06",
      "hash64": "794C37F237DE2C09",
      "text": "Indeed, I have been swept up in joy to such an\\nextent that I prepared a tremendous amount of\\r\\nthe flight-enabling supplement used in my trial.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_12",
      "hash64": "7948B1F237DB1280",
      "text": "Please feed your Agias an appropriate portion\\nof it whenever you wish to fly.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_01",
      "hash64": "0D2282BD495E0C0C",
      "text": "Gias!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_02",
      "hash64": "0D2285BD495E1125",
      "text": "*chomp chomp* *snarf* *chomp*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_13",
      "hash64": "7948B2F237DB1433",
      "text": "Wha—? You want to fly right now?\\c\\nPlease, slow down. The supplement was never\\nmeant to be eaten in such large—[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_03",
      "hash64": "0D2284BD495E0F72",
      "text": "Agiaaas!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_system_01",
      "hash64": "1EA3E8AF2CA275D4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)] will be able to fly now!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_07",
      "hash64": "794C36F237DE2A56",
      "text": "It would seem your Agias has...powered up\\nsomehow.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_08",
      "hash64": "794C41F237DE3D07",
      "text": "From the looks of it, I would guess that it has\\ngained the power to fly whenever you wish it to.\\c\\nWell. I suppose this is an acceptable outcome...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_09",
      "hash64": "794C40F237DE3B54",
      "text": "As it happens, we just finished setting up a\\n“super-hard” course for my Flying Time Trial.\\c\\nDo give it a try if you are confident in your skills.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_10",
      "hash64": "7948B3F237DB15E6",
      "text": "As it happens, there is a “super-hard” course for\\nmy Flying Time Trial.\\c\\nYou may attempt it upon clearing the hard\\ncourse. Feel free to do so when you are ready.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_11",
      "hash64": "7948B4F237DB1799",
      "text": "Time for me to go. So long, then.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
